{"id":"a78c51ac-38e9-451d-b70b-52d8fcb9c55f","object":"chat.completion","created":1793244801,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"thought\":\"Update multi-agent note with p47 (Generative Agents believability evaluated by 100 human evaluators, 1052-person simulation) and overview/outlook with discussion pages 47-48.\",\"code\":\"write_note(title='multi_agent', content='补记 p47：Generative Agents 的可信度由 100 名人类评估者（100 human evaluators）按四类（记忆过去、计划未来、应对意外、反思改进）排序语言交流模式；研究 full architecture 与 no observation/reflection/planning 四种架构，全架构最好；GPT-3.5。1000 人模拟：1052 人接受两小时 AI 访谈生成 1052 个 agent 画像，General Social Survey 复现准确率 85%。引用：Whether the Generative Agents system generates believable behavior is evaluated with the help of 100 human evaluators.', evidence_ids=['ev-f03e4b7f1b7fc6e66886'], section='multi_agent')\\nwrite_note(title='overview', content='补记 p48 §5：三类能力（reasoning、acting、interacting）互相支撑——工具使用由第一类推理 LLM、自我反思与检索增强促成；社会行为受益于推理与自我反思，社会行动愈发有根据。agent 产生训练数据可增强推理时行为并继续预训练/微调，形成 Figure 1 的持续改进循环。', evidence_ids=['ev-aa9b9dbdfec8c640b495'], section='overview')\"}"},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":8717,"completion_tokens":334,"total_tokens":9051,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":4480},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":4480,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":4237},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}